[15.445, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001bM\u001b[J\u001b[30A\u001b[5C\u001b[1K Thread A and clicks Thread B in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8015991529845862;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/thread_sidebar.dart\u0007ThreadSidebar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, the unsent draft remains in the input box for Thread B.\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> 1. Add a concept of projects that set a working directory for the Antigravity harness.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  2. I'm guessing workspaceOnly enables commands that are inside the sandbox. We should add UI that allows programs to\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  be run that want to escape the sandbox, but only after review by the user.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  3. Update README.md and add `/skills/` to `.gitignore`.\u001b[m\n\n\u001b[43D\u001b[37m3m 7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial analysis suggests that the `workspaceOnly` setting within the observed package might c...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 5 files \u001b["]
[0.001, "o", "37m(policy.dart, hooks.dart, capabilities.dart, +2)\u001b[m\n\u001b[65D\u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(grep -rn \"workspaceOnly\\|enableSandbox\\|confirmRunCommand\\|disable_sandbox\\|DisableSandbox\\|sandbox\" /Users/...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m\u2026 12 more actions (9 reads, 3 commands) \u2026\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(README.md)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 7 commands \u001b[37m(+2 \u00b7 strings ~/.antigravi... \u00d73 \u00b7 python3 -c ' with op... \u00d72)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I am inspecting the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m binary's sandbox and policy handling and will follow up as soon as the check\r\n  finishes.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m\u25cb\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 2m 14s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(I'm thinking through how to approach this.)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 3 commands \u001b[37m(python3 -c ' with op... \u00d73)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(.gitignore)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(.gitignore)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u28df  \u001b[90mEditing fil\u001b[94mes...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m\u2514 Tip: In request-review mode, file edits are shown f"]
