[0.0, "o", "ted workspace.\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mUI\u001b[m:\n\b\u2022 Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk55add37fa7a4eb24;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/project_dialog.dart\u0007ProjectDialog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 for creating projects and editing a project's working directory (with quick presets for\r\n\u001b[6CCurrent Directory, Home \u001b[94m~\u001b[m, and System Temp).\n\u001b[44D\u2022 Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf8c10a40aca78630;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/thread_sidebar.dart\u0007ThreadSidebar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a project switcher header, working directory path badge, and buttons to create or\r\n\u001b[6Cedit projects.\n\u001b[14D\u2022 Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk95fd60293e7ba91f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a clickable workspace path badge (\u001b[94mtoolbar_project_badge\u001b[m).\r\n\n\n  \u001b[1m### 2. Sandboxing, \u001b[94mworkspaceOnly\u001b[39m, & Sandbox-Escape User Review UI\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mHow \u001b[94;22mpackage:antigravity\u001b[39;1m separates these layers\u001b[m:\n\u001b[45D\u2022 \u001b[9"]
[0.0, "o", "4mworkspaceOnly(workspaces)\u001b[m only confines \u001b[1mfile manipulation tools\u001b[m (\u001b[94mview_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcreate_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94medit_file\u001b[m) to the\r\n\u001b[6Cworkspace when paired with \u001b[94mallowAll()\u001b[m.\n\u001b[38D\u2022 \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig(runCommandConfig: RunCommandConfig(enableSandbox: true))\u001b[m enables the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m OS-level\r\n\u001b[6Ccommand sandbox (\u001b[94mexebox\u001b[m) so standard \u001b[94mrun_command\u001b[m executions (\u001b[94mBypassSandbox: false\u001b[m) run confined to the project\r\n\u001b[6Cworkspace.\n\u001b[10D\u2022 Commands that want to escape the sandbox either set \u001b[94mBypassSandbox: true\u001b[m on \u001b[94mrun_command\u001b[m, reference paths\r\n\u001b[6Coutside the project workspace, or are flagged by \u001b[94mauto(handler: ...)\u001b[m.\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mImplementation\u001b[m:\n\u001b[13D\u2022 \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1ed623116f68abd5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L294-L364\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 configures \u001b[94mRunCommandConfig(enableSandbox: true)\u001b[m alongside\n\u001b[92D\u001b[94mworkspaceOnly(resolvedWorkspaces)\u001b[m, an \u001b[94"]
